668e0024b0814d9181768736da410902,8991236a1afc41928d5e2e144f0e2a43,spgispeech5,c_1oz75r2,ai,True,False,True,spgispeech,Supported,high,background,False,False,2,"SPGISpeech, released in 2021 and expanded in 2025~, provides over 5,000 hours of professionally transcribed earnings-call audio.",,,"We present baseline Conformer-based models trained on a corpus of 5,000 hours of professionally transcribed earnings calls, achieving a CER of 1.7. ||| SPGISpeech: 5,000 hours of transcribed financial audio for fully formatted end-to-end speech recognition Patrick K."
