ffe31a75069c4e00ad13e5d0048ed1ff,0ef2f81b7a824b5891f6fc46ee7ecc7c,rajpurkar2016squad7,c_138u0y8,ai,True,False,True,rajpurkar2016squad,Supported,medium,background,False,False,2,"To represent the SQuAD dataset~, for example, which has a question and a passage as inputs and a span from the passage as output, each training Instance comprises a TextField for the question, a TextField for the passage, and a SpanField representing the start and end positions of the answer in the passage.",True,,"Each of the answers is a segment of text from the passage. a critical role for driving fields forward—famous examples include ImageNet for object recognition (Deng et al., 2009) and the Penn Treebank for syntactic parsing (Marcus et al., 1993). ||| To address the need for a large and high-quality reading comprehension dataset, we present the Stan- ford Question Answering Dataset v1.0 (SQuAD), freely available at https://stanford-qa.com, consisting of questions posed by crowdworkers on a set of Wikipedia articles, where the answer to every question is a segment of text, or span, from the corresponding reading passage."
ffe31a75069c4e00ad13e5d0048ed1ff,0ef2f81b7a824b5891f6fc46ee7ecc7c,scikit-learn30,c_10cbee,ai,True,False,True,scikit-learn,Supported,medium,other,False,False,2,"This emphasis on configuring parameters, training, and evaluating is similar to Weka~ or Scikit-learn~, but AllenNLP focuses on cutting-edge research in deep learning and is designed around declarative configuration of model architectures in addition to model parameters.",True,,"Scikit-learn harnesses this rich environment to provide state-of-the-art implementations of many well known machine learning algorithms, while maintaining an easy-to-use interface tightly integrated with the Python language. ||| Scikit-learn is a Python module integrating a wide range of state-of-the-art machine learning algorithms for medium-scale supervised and unsupervised problems."
